    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. i'll try the fertilizer once i get the watering under control. one other thing though, i noticed some tiny little dark spots on the stems too. they're kind of small and hard to see, but they're also kind of weird looking. i didn't see any bugs when i looked closer, but they just seem... out of place? is there anything else that could cause spots like that?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
